# Build scratch (the prebuilt payloads in out/ and truehd-out/ ARE committed)
*.ipk
build/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store

# dts2lpcm/ — archived investigation record. Path A (demuxer retag + in-pipeline
# converter) was REFUTED on hardware 2026-07-24 and nothing here ever shipped.
# Its docs and sources may be committed as a record if desired; its build
# artifacts must not — the binaries are on-device-refuted, so committing them
# would violate .claude/rules/releasing.md. Working copies live out-of-repo at
# dts_restore_work/dts2lpcm-archive/.
#
# DELIBERATELY SCOPED to dts2lpcm/. Do NOT generalise these to a bare `*.so`
# here: the shipped out/, truehd-out/ and demux-out/ binaries are tracked ON
# PURPOSE, and rule #1 requires re-committing them after any rebuild. A blanket
# ignore would make `git add` silently skip a rebuilt decoder.
dts2lpcm/**/*.so
dts2lpcm/out/
dts2lpcm/test/work/t/
dts2lpcm/test/work/native/
